                                                "sense_id": "18a6e354-9e84-3b71-8e00-ed68bbe609e1",
                                                "text": "‘[S]he carelessly bound a glowing wreath of African marygolds and purple China-aster, surmounting the whole with a light kerchief of pink Italian gauze, embroidered by herself in lilies of the valley.’"
